  "summary": "Coupe (19437) removable roof panel (T-top) weatherstrips and drip moldings: the weatherstrip around the underside edge of each roof panel, its retainer, the side and front drip moldings (drip rails), and the corner cap and plate. The retainer and side drip molding are riveted to the roof panel, the weatherstrip is screwed and push-fastened into the retainer and sealed with 55e, and the plate at the rear corner is screwed on; the drip moldings are sealed with 84n/84c compound.",
